---
description: >-
  Happy path for actor styling: a classDef attached to one actor via the
  class keyword, and an inline style on another actor.
---
sequenceDiagram
  classDef highlighted fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  class Alice highlighted
  style Bob fill:#bbf,stroke:#00f
  Alice->>Bob: Hello
  Bob-->>Alice: Hi back
